  "metadata": {
    "createdAt": "2026-10-26T09:04:17.698Z",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-10-26T09:04:31.397Z",
    "projectName": "project-ff1e35a3",
    "platform": "react-native",
    "originalPrompt": "create an app called MY MIB: \"est une plateforme de gestion financière intelligente qui accompagne les particuliers, les professionnels et les entreprises dans la maîtrise de leurs finances.Notre mission est de rendre la gestion de l’argent plus simple, plus accessible et plus efficace grâce à des outils de suivi budgétaire, d’analyse des dépenses, de planification financière et de gestion des revenus.Au-delà de la gestion financière, MY MIB aide également ses utilisateurs à réaliser des économi",
    "generationSummary": "## MY MIB: Finance personnelle et pro (project-ff1e35a3)\n\n**App Type**: finance (personal and business finance management with partner offers)\n**Tech Stack**: Expo SDK ~57.0.28, React Native 0.86.3, Expo Router, Zustand, NativeWind-style classes, built-in Animated API\n\n### Implemented Screens\n- app/index.tsx: splash + 3-slide onboarding (KPI card preview illustration), profile type, income, first envelopes\n- app/(auth)/login.tsx: email/password + biometric unlock, error display\n- app/(auth)/signup.tsx: account creation with validation\n- app/(tabs)/index.tsx: Glass Finance home dashboard (brand lockup, parallax KPI donut hero, allocation chips, insights, recent activity)\n- app/(tabs)/budget.tsx: envelopes, analysis bars, goals, subscriptions\n- app/(tabs)/offers.tsx: partner offers catalogue, categories, activated wallet, cashback\n- app/(tabs)/profile.tsx: profile, plan, security toggles, accounts, export, logout\n- app/transaction/[id].tsx: transaction detail\n- app/goal/[id].tsx: savings goal + 90-day forecast detail\n\n### Key Files & Responsibilities\n- types/index.ts: domain interfaces\n- constants/Colors.ts: Glass Finance palette (light + dark)\n- store/useStore.ts: Zustand finance store (async actions, mock rows)\n- store/useAuthStore.ts: auth store (isInitializing / isSubmitting split)\n- components/ui/*: Button, Card (glass), Input, Badge, Avatar, Skeleton\n- components/shared/*: RingChart (svg), DeltaChip, AllocationChips, FloatingDock, TransactionRow, SectionHeader, EmptyState\n- components/motion/*: ParallaxHeader, CountUp, FadeInView, Pressable scale\n\n### Design Tokens Applied\n- Colors: primary #38bdf8, secondary #8b5cf6, accent #10b981, bg #f5f6fa, text #0f172a\n- Typography: display 48 semibold tabular, heading 18 semibold, body 14, label 12 medium\n- Spacing/Radius: 20pt page padding, 28pt card radius, full pills\n\n### Important Patterns & Conventions\n- Archetype: floating pill dock, no photos, SVG ring hero, glass cards via expo-blur\n- All data access through Zustand async actions; EUR / fr-FR formatting via Intl\n- Animated API only (no reanimated)\n\n### Implemented Features\n- Onboarding, signup, login, biometric unlock, error states\n- KPI hero with donut ring, count-up, parallax tilt\n- Budget envelopes with thresholds, goals, subscriptions, offers, cashback, exports, logout\n\n### How to Run\n```bash\ncd project-ff1e35a3\nnpm install\nnpx expo start\n```"
  }
